<title>ITALY: Parmalat to unveil big N.America operation.</title>
<headline>Parmalat to unveil big N.America operation.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian food group Parmalat has called a news conference at 1700 GMT here to announce &quot;an important operation in North America&quot;, a source close to the group said.</p>
<p>The source gave no other details but other informed sources said the announcement was expected to &quot;involve the U.S. banking group Citicorp /Citibank&quot;.</p>
<p>Recently the market has speculated that Parmalat might be interested in the Canadian group Beatrice Foods.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
